{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114021959836-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114083150\"/><p>澳門氣象局於今日(14日)凌晨2時15分發出黃色暴雨警告信號，其後於今晨4時30分取消。</p><p>高空擾動正影響澳門天氣。今日多雲，後轉天晴。初時有幾陣驟雨。吹3至4級偏北風。氣溫約為攝氏21至28度。相對濕度介乎百分之60至98之間。預測最高紫外線指數約為7，級別屬於高。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.553564+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T18:19:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:04.042218+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:38.235505+00:00","content_hash":"1276e43c46ce18f4b739228537def79128035c210fde7f2e20105c098ff4f48e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.553564+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}